msgid "# Quickstart"
msgstr "# 快速开始"

msgid ""
"This guide helps you quickly run your first inference or online serving "
"workload with a prebuilt vLLM Ascend container on a prepared Ascend host."
msgstr "本指南用于帮助你在已经准备好的 Ascend 主机上，使用 vLLM Ascend 预构建容器快速完成第一次推理或在线服务。"

msgid ""
"If you have not yet installed the Ascend driver, firmware, or Docker, or if you want to prepare the runtime environment with pip, an existing CANN environment, or a source build, first read\n"
"[Installation Guide > 2. Check the Host Environment](installation.md#installation-host)."
msgstr ""
"如果你还没有安装 Ascend 驱动、固件或 Docker，或者希望使用 pip、已有 CANN 环境、源码构建等方式准备运行环境，请先阅读\n"
"[安装指南 > 2. 检查 Host 环境](installation.md#installation-host)。"

msgid "## 1. Verify the Environment {: #quickstart-prerequisites }"
msgstr "## 1. 环境验证 {: #quickstart-prerequisites }"

msgid ""
"Quickstart performs only the minimum environment checks. Run the following "
"commands on the **host**:"
msgstr "Quickstart 只做最小环境检查。请在 **Host 主机** 上运行："

msgid "You can continue when both of the following conditions are met:"
msgstr "满足以下条件即可继续："

msgid ""
"- `npu-smi info` lists the Ascend NPU that you plan to use.\n"
"- The Docker daemon is accessible and the command prints `Docker access: OK`."
msgstr ""
"- `npu-smi info` 能看到准备使用的 Ascend NPU；\n"
"- Docker daemon 可访问，并输出 `Docker access: OK`。"

msgid ""
"If either check fails, follow\n"
"[Installation Guide > 2.1 Troubleshoot Host Check Failures](installation.md#installation-host-troubleshooting)\n"
"to prepare and verify the host environment before continuing."
msgstr ""
"如果任一检查失败，请先按照\n"
"[安装指南 > 2.1 Host 检查失败时](installation.md#installation-host-troubleshooting)\n"
"完成 Host 环境准备和安装验证。"

msgid ""
"If Docker is not yet installed, go directly to the\n"
"[official Docker Engine installation guide](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/), select the Linux distribution that matches your host, and return to this page after the installation is complete."
msgstr ""
"Docker 尚未安装时，直接前往\n"
"[Docker Engine 官方安装指南](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/)，选择 Host 对应的 Linux 发行版；安装完成后再返回本页。"

msgid ""
"!!! important \"Confirm hardware support\"\n"
"    If you are unsure whether your product supports vLLM Ascend, see [Installation Guide > 1. Identify Your Hardware](installation.md#installation-hardware)."
msgstr ""
"!!! important \"确认硬件支持\"\n"
"    如果你不确定所用产品是否支持 vLLM Ascend，请查阅 [安装指南 > 1. 确定你的硬件](installation.md#installation-hardware)。"

msgid ""
"## 2. Confirm Version Compatibility {: #quickstart-version-compatibility }"
msgstr "## 2. 确认版本配套 {: #quickstart-version-compatibility }"

msgid ""
"This Quickstart uses a single release baseline by default. It does not "
"maintain separate software version matrices for different hardware products."
msgstr "本 Quickstart 默认使用同一套发布基线，不按硬件维护不同的软件版本矩阵。"

msgid "### 2.1 Current Release Stack {: #quickstart-release-stack }"
msgstr "### 2.1 当前发布配套 {: #quickstart-release-stack }"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/software_stack.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/software_stack.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "!!! important \"Keep the entire version stack compatible\""
msgstr "!!! important \"保持整套版本匹配\""

msgid ""
"Upgrading vLLM, vLLM Ascend, CANN, PyTorch/TorchNPU, or Triton Ascend individually in a prebuilt image is not recommended.\n"
"    If you need other versions, use a complete compatible combination instead of replacing only one component."
msgstr ""
"不建议在预构建镜像中单独升级 vLLM、vLLM Ascend、CANN、PyTorch/TorchNPU 或 Triton Ascend。\n"
"    如果需要其他版本，请使用完整的兼容性组合，而不是只替换其中一个组件。"

msgid ""
"For other releases, see the project-maintained\n"
"    [Release compatibility matrix](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-compatibility-matrix),\n"
"    and switch the entire stack together. For more installation options, see\n"
"    [Installation Guide > 3. Confirm Software Compatibility](installation.md#installation-release-stack)."
msgstr ""
"其他发布版本请查阅项目维护的\n"
"    [Release compatibility matrix](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-compatibility-matrix)，\n"
"    然后整套切换。更完整的安装方式见\n"
"    [安装指南 > 3. 确认软件配套](installation.md#installation-release-stack)。"

msgid ""
"## 3. Select Your Hardware and Run the Example {: #quickstart-hardware }"
msgstr "## 3. 选择硬件并运行 {: #quickstart-hardware }"

msgid ""
"Select a path based on the actual product name of your device. An image tag "
"might contain a chip-series suffix, but you should still select the path "
"based on the product name of your server or accelerator card."
msgstr "请按照设备的实际产品名称选择路径。镜像标签中可能包含芯片系列后缀，选择时仍以服务器或加速卡的产品名称为准。"

msgid "| Your hardware | Example on this page | Path provided on this page |"
msgstr "| 你的硬件 | 本页示例 | 本页提供的路径 |"

msgid ""
"| [Atlas A2](#quickstart-atlas-a2-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` | "
"Container, offline inference, and online serving |"
msgstr "| [Atlas A2](#quickstart-atlas-a2-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` | 容器、离线推理、在线服务 |"

msgid ""
"| [Atlas A3](#quickstart-atlas-a3-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` | "
"Container, offline inference, and online serving |"
msgstr "| [Atlas A3](#quickstart-atlas-a3-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` | 容器、离线推理、在线服务 |"

msgid ""
"| [Atlas 300I DUO](#quickstart-atlas-300i-duo-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B`"
" | Container, offline inference status, and online serving |"
msgstr "| [Atlas 300I DUO](#quickstart-atlas-300i-duo-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B` | 容器、离线状态、在线服务 |"

msgid ""
"| [Atlas 200I Pro](#quickstart-atlas-200i-pro-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B`"
" | Container, offline inference status, and online serving |"
msgstr "| [Atlas 200I Pro](#quickstart-atlas-200i-pro-container) | `Qwen/Qwen3.5-2B` | 容器、离线状态、在线服务 |"

msgid ""
"| [Atlas 950DT](#quickstart-atlas-950dt-container) | DeepSeek-V4-Flash "
"reference path | Container, environment verification, and model-specific "
"documentation |"
msgstr "| [Atlas 950DT](#quickstart-atlas-950dt-container) | DeepSeek-V4-Flash 参考路径 | 容器、环境验证、模型专用文档 |"

msgid "Select your hardware below and follow the steps in order."
msgstr "下面选择你的硬件并按顺序执行。"

msgid ""
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-a2.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-a3.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-300i-duo.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-200i-pro.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-950dt.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr ""
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-a2.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-a3.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-300i-duo.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-200i-pro.inc.md\" %}\n"
"{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/atlas-950dt.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "## 4. Troubleshooting {: #quickstart-troubleshooting }"
msgstr "## 4. 常见问题 {: #quickstart-troubleshooting }"

msgid ""
"This section contains only a few entry points for issues that directly affect Quickstart. For comprehensive environment troubleshooting, see the [Installation Guide](installation.md)\n"
"and [FAQs](../faqs.md)."
msgstr ""
"这里只保留会直接影响 Quickstart 的少量入口。完整环境问题请查看 [安装指南](installation.md)\n"
"和 [FAQs](../faqs.md)。"

msgid "??? tip \"The image pull is slow or fails\""
msgstr "??? tip \"镜像拉取很慢或失败\""

msgid ""
"`docker pull` is initiated by the Docker daemon. Proxy variables in the "
"shell do not automatically configure the Docker daemon."
msgstr "`docker pull` 由 Docker daemon 发起，Shell 中的代理变量不会自动配置 Docker daemon。"

msgid ""
"Use a registry mirror or Docker daemon proxy permitted by your organization."
msgstr "请使用组织允许的 registry mirror 或 Docker daemon proxy。"

msgid "??? tip \"The model download fails\""
msgstr "??? tip \"模型下载失败\""

msgid "If the model is available on ModelScope, you can use:"
msgstr "如果模型在 ModelScope 可用，可以使用："

msgid "??? tip \"The service does not become ready\""
msgstr "??? tip \"服务没有 ready\""

msgid "Check the `vllm serve` logs first. Common causes include:"
msgstr "优先查看 `vllm serve` 日志。常见原因包括："

msgid ""
"- The model download failed.\n"
"    - NPU memory is insufficient.\n"
"    - The host driver does not match the image.\n"
"    - The device mapping is incorrect.\n"
"    - Model-specific parameters are incorrect."
msgstr ""
"- 模型下载失败；\n"
"    - NPU 显存不足；\n"
"    - Host driver 与镜像不匹配；\n"
"    - device mapping 错误；\n"
"    - 模型专用参数错误。"

msgid "## 5. Next Steps {: #quickstart-next-steps }"
msgstr "## 5. 下一步 {: #quickstart-next-steps }"

msgid ""
"- See [Supported Models](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to select more models.\n"
"- See [Model Tutorials](../tutorials/models/index.md) for model-specific deployment steps.\n"
"- See [Installation Guide > 4. Choose an Installation Method](installation.md#installation-methods)\n"
"  to learn about pip, CANN, and source installations.\n"
"- See [Feature Tutorials](../tutorials/features/index.md) to learn about distributed and advanced features.\n"
"- See [FAQs](../faqs.md) to troubleshoot common deployment issues."
msgstr ""
"- 查看 [Supported Models](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) 选择更多模型；\n"
"- 查看 [Model Tutorials](../tutorials/models/index.md) 获取模型专用部署步骤；\n"
"- 查看 [安装指南 > 4. 选择安装方式](installation.md#installation-methods)\n"
"  了解 pip、CANN 和源码安装；\n"
"- 查看 [Feature Tutorials](../tutorials/features/index.md) 学习分布式和高级特性；\n"
"- 查看 [FAQs](../faqs.md) 处理常见部署问题。"
